Свидетельства:
  - Реализован GET-only OneBase REST-read adapter executeOnebaseRestGet: allowlist endpoints catalogs/documents/registers/inforegs/reports/widgets/constants/health/status, blocker для missing ONEBASE_API_BASE_URL и forbidden paths, evidence-record.v1 для HTTP result.
  - Подключено к worker tools как onebase.restGet и MCP как onebase_rest_get.
  - Добавлены тесты в tests/onebaseRestEvidenceAdapter.test.mjs и tests/workgraph-mcp-contract.test.mjs: missing base URL, allowlist reject, mocked successful GET, MCP handler evidence.
  - Verification: node --test tests/onebaseRestEvidenceAdapter.test.mjs tests/workgraph-mcp-contract.test.mjs tests/onebaseWorkerTools.test.mjs => 27/27 pass; npm run test:deterministic => 841/841 pass.
